      "trigger": "weekly",
      "invocation": "automated",
      "description": "A weekly job asks the issues API for unresolved issues created before the limit and fails on those without the tag escalated or accepted-debt (tags are set on the issue in the platform); accepting an issue as won't fix with a reason resolves it and takes it out of the list.\n\nThreshold: 0 unresolved issues created more than {{MAX_DEBT_AGE_DAYS}} days ago without the tag escalated or accepted-debt\n\nTool: SonarQube web API (api/issues/search) with curl and jq\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# weekly: unresolved issues older than the limit carry an escalation or acceptance tag\nset -euo pipefail\nbefore=$(date -u -d '{{MAX_DEBT_AGE_DAYS}} days ago' +%F 2>/dev/null || date -u -v-{{MAX_DEBT_AGE_DAYS}}d +%F)\nold=$(curl -sf -u \"$SONAR_TOKEN:\" \"$SONAR_URL/api/issues/search?componentKeys=$PROJECT_KEY&resolved=false&createdBefore=$before&ps=500\" \\\n  | jq -r '.issues[] | select((.tags | index(\"escalated\") == null) and (.tags | index(\"accepted-debt\") == null)) | \"\\(.key) \\(.creationDate[:10]) \\(.message)\"')\n[ -z \"$old\" ] || { echo \"issues older than {{MAX_DEBT_AGE_DAYS}} days without a decision:\"; echo \"$old\"; exit 1; }\n```",
      "hubWhen": {
        "AGE": [
          "max-age"
        ],
        "REGISTRY": [
          "tool"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
